<!-- Our Story -->
<section class="about-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="story-text fade-in">
        <span class="section-tag">Our Story</span>
        <h2>Two guys who thought small business deserved better</h2>
        <p>GullStack was founded by <strong>Bryce Morgan</strong> and <strong>Josh</strong> in Utah. They kept seeing the same thing: small businesses paying $500/month for a CRM they barely used, another $300 for a website that didn't rank, another $200 for email marketing, and 3-8% on every credit card swipe. Thousands of dollars a month going to disconnected tools that didn't talk to each other.</p>
        <p>Bryce brought years of digital marketing and business development experience. Josh brought deep software engineering and AI systems expertise. Together, they asked a simple question: <strong>What if one team could do all of it — and actually make it work together?</strong></p>
        <p>That question became GullStack. An agency that combines human marketing strategy with AI-powered engineering to deliver real results at prices that don't require a second mortgage.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-box fade-in">
        <blockquote>We believe every small business deserves the same marketing firepower as a Fortune 500 company — without the Fortune 500 price tag.</blockquote>
        <div class="mission-attr">— The founding principle behind everything we build</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

